OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be mainly dry with just the odd
OL,7,Fpassing light shower. Then the rest of
OL,8,Fthe night will be cloudy with spells
OL,9,Fof rain spreading from the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FCloudy with rain at times,
OL,12,Falthough Shetland may turn drier and
OL,13,Fsomewhat drier for a time in the
OL,14,Fafternoon. Fresh southwesterly winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,17,Fand breezy with rain at times on
OL,18,FSaturday. Brighter on Sunday with just
OL,19,Fthe odd shower. Dry on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
